1
00:00:03,628 --> 00:00:06,008
(Leonard:)Why do I always have
to carry the heavy stuff?

2
00:00:06,172 --> 00:00:07,342
(Sheldon:)Well, it's very simple.

3
00:00:07,507 --> 00:00:10,507
(Sheldon:)In our ragtag band of scientists
with nothing to lose...

4
00:00:10,677 --> 00:00:13,137
(Sheldon:)...I'm the smart one.
Wolowitz is the funny one.

5
00:00:13,304 --> 00:00:15,264
(Sheldon:)Koothrappali is the lovable foreigner...

6
00:00:15,432 --> 00:00:17,812
(Sheldon:)...who struggles to understand our ways
and fails.

7
00:00:20,311 --> 00:00:22,561
(Sheldon:)That leaves you, by default,
as the muscle.

8
00:00:24,691 --> 00:00:27,821
(Leonard:)One more floor
and I'd be the pulled muscle.

9
00:00:28,528 --> 00:00:30,068
(Penny(who is inside the apartment):)Oh, it's about time. I'm starving.

10
00:00:30,238 --> 00:00:33,158
(Leonard:)Uh, well,
we didn't actually get Chinese food.

11
00:00:33,658 --> 00:00:35,748
(Penny:)-Why not?
-Don't panic. This is better.

12
00:00:35,910 --> 00:00:39,290
(Penny:)Oh, no. You didn't trade the food
for magic beans, did you?

13
00:00:40,498 --> 00:00:43,878
(Sheldon:)Of course not. And, technically,
magic beans would be food.

14
00:00:44,044 --> 00:00:46,924
Eating them would be a waste,
since you could plant them...

15
00:00:47,088 --> 00:00:51,928
...and have a giant beanstalk which
would provide roughage for a small city.

16
00:00:52,510 --> 00:00:54,010
(Penny:)Yeah, sometimes I don't listen.

17
00:00:54,179 --> 00:00:56,509
(Penny:)Sometimes I just watch your jaw
go up and down.

18
00:00:58,183 --> 00:00:59,893
We were on our way to the restaurant.

19
00:01:00,060 --> 00:01:02,190
(Leonard:)We saw Adam West, so we followed him.

